@startuml
actor "Browser" as A
boundary "React UI" as UI
control "JwtAuthenticationFilter" as JF
control "SecurityConfig" as SC
control "Controller" as C
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Xác thực JWT & Phân quyền Request ==
A -> UI : 1. Gửi request + Authorization: Bearer JWT
UI -> JF : 2. HTTP request
JF -> JF : 3. Verify signature + extract user id
JF -> DB : 4. Load AppUser
DB --> JF : 5. AppUser / state
JF -> SC : 6. Authenticated principal + authorities

alt Đủ quyền
  SC -> C : 7a. Allow (Cho phép truy cập)
  C --> UI : 8a. 2xx Success Response
else Thiếu / sai quyền
  SC --> UI : 7b. 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden
end

UI --> A : 9. Hiển thị kết quả / thông báo lỗi
@enduml